#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "84_Sweet Girl"
msgid "Hey, darling! I just got back from Okinawa!"
msgstr "¡Cariño! ¡Acabo de volver de Okinawa!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "96_Cool Boy"
msgid "Uh... What? When did you go to Okinawa? We've been hanging out like, every day these last few weeks."
msgstr "Eh... ¿Cuándo te fuiste a Okinawa? Hemos estado saliendo creo que todos los días de las últimas semanas."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "108_Sweet Girl"
msgid "Online, silly! I signed up for this thing called Amoebatar. You can make your little person go all sorts of places!"
msgstr "¡Por internet, tontito! Me creé una cuenta en esa cosa de Amoebatar. ¡Puedes hacer que tu avatar visite varios lugares!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "120_Cool Boy"
msgid "Oh. Is that the thing where you make an avatar, and then use it to play games and stuff?"
msgstr "Ah, ¿esa cosa donde te creas un mini-me y juegas con él?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "132_Sweet Girl"
msgid "That's right! Some of my online friends and I went on a virtual trip to Okinawa. You should give it a try, darling!"
msgstr "¡Sí! Yo y mis amigas fuimos de viaje virtual a Okinawa. ¡Deberías probarlo, cariño!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "144_Cool Boy"
msgid "Hmmm... If I did, you might stop begging me to take you places all the time..."
msgstr "Mmmm… Si lo hago puede que dejes de estarme pidiendo salir todo el tiempo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "156_Sweet Girl"
msgid "Huh? What was that?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Qué dijiste?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "168_Cool Boy"
msgid "Oh, nothing!"
msgstr "¡Ah, nada!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "180_Cool Boy"
msgid "I'll sign up when I get home. Amoebatar, right?"
msgstr "Cuando llegue a casa, me crearé una cuenta, ¿bueno?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "192_Sweet Girl"
msgid "Yay! I love you sooo much, darling! Hey, once you get signed up, let's go to Okinawa together!"
msgstr "¡Síí! ¡Te amo muchísimo! ¡Cuando te la crees, iremos a Okinawa juntos!"

